out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('Each student reads their share **twice** — once with the stress on the figure and once on the hedge — and the room says which sounded like a measurement. ⚠ The difference is audible and the class will hear it at once; what they will not do unprompted is read their own share flat. Close on Rasha\'s line: **she thought she was contradicting me, and she was giving me the second of my own two.**'));
