out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('The falsifier for each of the eight, and whether the figure already exists. The count: **two of the eight cards cannot be falsified at all** — _people are careless_ and _a culture of not reading the sheets_ — and a third, _that one was an exception_, is the machine for swallowing counter-examples. ⚠ And the finding: **in four or five of the remaining five the figure already exists** and nobody has looked it up. Collect the documents by name and write them on the board: _the ward file · the repeat log · the service book · the spreadsheet_.'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
