  '**One thing to keep, and why.** _We have managed the condition by accident, because repeat callers are routed to the three of us who have been there longest._ **Keep it because it is the only thing in the page that is already working**, and a reader who is told what is working will believe what you say is not.   **Ranking the slip I was given.** Most useful: the note on the accidental management, which I had written without noticing it was the strongest line. Then the removal test. Least useful: the three dated facts, which the writer\'s box had already told me to do.',
