out.push(A('Each student reads their trigger and the sentence about its supply, and **the room says what the next trigger will be**. ⚠ They are usually right, and being right is the point: a class that can predict the next trigger has understood why acting on one is expensive. Close on Tareq\'s line: **a trigger is cheap to act on and that is why it is expensive.**'));
