  '**2** _(a delay)_ **5** _Which predicts that the mornings when the service leaves on time will be mornings when a driver was in before six._ **6** _It does not predict that any driver is late by his own reading._ **Check:** the rota, and the depot door log.',
  '**3** _(an empty field)_ **5** _Which predicts that escalations will cluster on customers who have called before._ **6** _It does not predict that nobody over-promises._ **Check:** the escalation spreadsheet, two columns side by side.',
