  '**The mechanism, in six sentences.** **1** The October form reads _lot number — where applicable_ and names no author. **2** So each shift decides for itself what it applies to. **3** The night shift has decided it applies to pharmacy-supplied items only. **4** The box is empty on night sheets and completed on day sheets, and the file looks consistent because both are signed. **5** **Which predicts that the empty boxes fall almost entirely in one column of the ward file** — nineteen of nineteen. **6** **It does not predict that any patient had the wrong thing.**',
