out.push(A('Each student reads the symptom sentence flat, pauses, then reads sentence five. ⚠ **The room judges the pause**, which is almost always too short: the sentence everybody says needs two or three seconds of silence after it, or the mechanism sounds like a contradiction of it. Close on Ms Huda\'s sentence: **a symptom explanation is not refuted by reasoning; it is refuted by what it cost and did not change.**'));
