  '**The one cause.** The October form reads _lot number — where applicable_ and names no author. **Remove it — one line saying what the phrase applies to — and both complaints stop:** the boxes are completed on both shifts, so there is nothing for the auditor to ask and nothing for the day staff to add after a signature.',
  '**Why neither of them can see it.** The day staff see an auditor\'s question. The night staff see their own signature under somebody else\'s handwriting. **Neither has any reason to look at the form itself, which is the thing in the middle.**',
